{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.poster.avif?t=1761937638\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.webm?t=1761937638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/ca7586d5c400aa800d4f927aa3a71100.mp4?t=1761937638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Welcome to EternaTIMA</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the corridors of EternaTIMA alone or with your friends, work for a company where not everything is as it seems, earn some money to pay the bills of your mom hospitalation and discover that your routine tasks hide dark secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Maintenance Tasks</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix generators, clean vents, activate machinery... Fill out your task board to complete your job. </strong><br><strong>(</strong><strong><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Without dying in the process</span></i></strong><strong>)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/b9e7f396821a3d581ddbfec876068df9.poster.avif?t=1761937638\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/b9e7f396821a3d581ddbfec876068df9.webm?t=1761937638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819030/extras/b9e7f396821a3d581dd